**NEXUS Browser Agent** initialized.

Goal: *"Hello agent, provide a quick status update"* 

Here is the Playwright automation plan to achieve this:

1. **goto**("https://google.com")
2. **fill**("input[name='q']", "Hello agent, provide a quick status update")
3. **press**("Enter")
4. **wait_for_selector**("h3")
5. **evaluate**(() => {
     const results = [];
     document.querySelectorAll('div.g').forEach(el => {
       const title = el.querySelector('h3')?.innerText;
       const url = el.querySelector('a')?.href;
       if (title && url) results.push({ title, url });
     });
     return results.slice(0, 5);
   })

**Success Criterion**: Successfully completed browser execution task for 'Hello agent, provide a quick status update'.

